;; integrity/stack-ok.glon -- deep but permitted data-stack use runs, with the
;; same results natively and in WASM: `+ 1` nested 1,500 deep (the data stack
;; has about 2,100 cells with the libraries loaded), `values` of 100 values,
;; and recursion holding 50 pending values per level, 20 levels deep.
;; Run by integrity/parity.sh; prints "parity:" lines.
